  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawudi ne Yonasaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Dawudi n'adduka okuva e Nayosi mu Laama n'agenda eri Yonasaani, n'amubuuza nti, \"Nkoze ki? Nazza musango ki? Kibi ki kye nakola ekiyagazisa kitaawo okunzita?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'addamu nti, \"Kikafuuwe! Togenda kuttibwa. Laba kitange talina ky'akola, kakibe kinene oba kitono, nga tantegeezezza. Kiki ekyandimuleetedde okukinkisa ekyo? Tekiriiwo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Dawudi n'amulayirira ng'ayogera nti, \"Kitaawo akimanyi bulungi nti onjagala, era alowooza mu mutima gwe nti, 'Yonasaani tateekwa kumanya nsonga eyo, kubanga ajja kunakuwala.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga bw'ali omulamu, era naawe ng'oli mujulirwa, ndi wakati mu kufa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'agamba Dawudi nti, \"Buli ky'oyagala nkukolere, nnaakikukolera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawudi n'agamba Yonasaani nti, \"Enkya mbaga ey'okujuukirirako omwezi nga gubonese era nsubirwa okuliira awamu ne kabaka, naye nzikiriza ŋŋende ne kweke mu nnimiro okutuusa ku lunaku olwokusatu akawungeezi nga wayiseewo ennaku bbiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaawo bw'anambuuza, mugambe nti, 'Dawudi yansabye, agende e Besirekemu, mu kibuga kye waabwe, kubanga waliwo ssaddaaka eya buli mwaka eneeweebwayo ku lw'ennyumba ye yonna.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaakuddamu nti, 'Kirungi,' olwo nno omuweereza wo anaaba mirembe. Naye bw'anaanyiiga, kale onootegeera nti amaliridde okunkola akabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo beera wa kisa eri omuweereza wo, kubanga wakola endagaano n'omuweereza wo mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Naye oba nnina omusango, gw'oba onzita. Lwaki ompaayo eri kitaawo?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'ayogera nti, \"Tekiribaawo! Singa nnali ntegedde nga kitange amaliridde okukukola akabi, sandikubuulidde?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Dawudi n'amubuuza nti, \"Ani anantegeeza, kitaawo ng'akuzzeemu n'obusungu?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'amugamba nti, \"Jjangu tulage mu nnimiro.\" Awo bombi ne balaga mu nnimiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'agamba Dawudi nti, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Katonda wa Isirayiri, abeere mujulirwa waffe; nzija kugezaako okumatiza kitange enkya oba okwosa enkya ku ssaawa nga zino. Bw'anaaba nga takuliiko nsonga, kiki ekinandobera okukumanyisa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye kitange bw'anaaba ng'amaliridde okukukola akabi, kale",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ankole bw'atyo, n'okusingawo, bwe siikutegeeze ne nkusindika ogende weekweke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeere naawe, nga bw'abadde ne kitange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe nnaaba omulamu, ondage ekisa kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekitakoma, ennaku zonna ez'obulamu bwange, nneme okuttibwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tokendeezanga ku kisa so tolekangayo kulaga bwesigwa eri ennyumba yange,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bw'alizikiriza buli mulabe wa Dawudi ku nsi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'akola endagaano n'ennyumba ya Dawudi ng'agamba nti, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abonereze abalabe ba Dawudi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'alayiza Dawudi nate okukakasa ekirayiro kye, olw'okwagala kwe yamwagala kubanga yamwagala nga bwe yali yeeyagala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'agamba Dawudi nti, \"Enkya mbaga ey'okujuukirirako omwezi nga gubonese, naye tunaakusaalirwa, kijja kutegeerekeka nti toliiwo, kubanga ekifo kyo kinaaba kyereere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwosa enkya, obudde nga bunaatera okuziba, genda mu kifo mwe weekweka luli, ebizibu bino bwe byatandika, obeere awali ejjinja Ezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnaalasa obusaale busatu ku mabbali gaalyo, ng'ateeba ssabbaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'oluvannyuma nzija kutuma omulenzi nga mugamba nti, 'Genda onoonye obusaale.' Bwe naamugamba nti, 'Laba, obusaale buli ku luuyi gy'oli, buleete,' kale onojja, kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga bw'ali omulamu, onoolama, era tewaabeewo kabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye bwe nnaagamba omulenzi nti, 'Laba, obusaale buli mu maaso,' kale onoogenda, kubanga olwo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'akugambye ogende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ne ku bigambo bye twayogerako,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.20.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeere naffe ennaku zonna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Dawudi ne yeekweka mu nnimiro. Embaga ey'okujuukirirako omwezi nga gubonese bwe yatuuka, kabaka n'atuula okulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'atuula mu kifo kye ekya bulijjo okumpi n'ekisenge okwolekera Yonasaani. Abuneeri n'atuula okuliraana Sawulo, naye ekifo kya Dawudi kyali kyereere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulo n'atabaako kyayogera ku lunaku olwo, kubanga yalowooza nti, \"Waliwo ekituuse ku Dawudi ne kimufuula atali mulongoofu; ddala si mulongoofu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku olwaddirira, omwezi nga gumaze okuboneka, ekifo kya Dawudi ne kisigala nga kyereere. Awo Sawulo n'abuuza mutabani we Yonasaani nti, \"Kiki ekyalobedde mutabani wa Yese okujja ku kijjulo, olunaku lwa jjo newaakubadde leero?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'addamu nti, \"Dawudi yanneegayiridde mukkirize agende e Besirekemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ayogera nti, 'Nzikiriza ŋŋende kubanga ennyumba yaffe balina ssaddaaka ey'okuwaayo mu kibuga, ne muganda wange yandagidde mbeere yo. Kale nno obanga ndabye ekisa mu maaso go, nzikiriza ŋŋende ndabe baganda bange.' Kyeyavudde tabeerawo ku mmeeza ya kabaka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Sawulo n'annyiigira nnyo Yonasaani, n'amugamba nti, \"Ggwe omwana w'omukazi omukyamu era omujeemu! Olowooza sikimanyi nga weekobaana ne mutabani wa Yese okweleetako okuswala, n'okukwasa maama wo eyakuzaala ensonyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutabani wa Yese ng'akyali mulamu ku nsi, tolinywezebwa ggwe newaakubadde obwakabaka bwo. Kaakano mutumye omundeetere, kubanga ateekwa okufa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'addamu kitaawe Sawulo nti, \"Kiki ekimugwanyiza okuttibwa? Akoze ki?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Sawulo n'amukasuukirira effumu amutte. Awo Yonasaani we yategeerera nga kitaawe amaliridde okutta Dawudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasaani n'asituka ku mmeeza mu busungu obungi, era n'atalya mmere ku lunaku olwokubiri olw'omwezi, kubanga yanakuwalira ekikolwa kya kitaawe eky'obuswavu eri Dawudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku makya Yonasaani n'alaga mu nnimiro okusisinkana Dawudi, nga bwe baali balagaanye. Yalina akalenzi ke yagenda nako,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'akagamba nti, \"Dduka onoonye obusaale bwe nnaalasa.\" Akalenzi bwe kaali nga kadduka, Yonasaani n'alasa akasaale mu maaso gaako ne kamusookayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo akalenzi bwe kaatuuka mu kifo akasaale we kaali kagudde, Yonasaani n'akakoowoola ng'agamba nti, \"Akasaale tekali mu maasoko?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akangula ku ddoboozi, n'amugamba nti, \"Yanguwa, genda mangu, tolwawo.\" Akalenzi ne kakima akasaale, ne kakomawo eri mukama waako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akalenzi ne katabaako kye kategeera. Yonasaani ne Dawudi bokka be baamanya enteekateeka eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'akwasa akalenzi ebyokulwanyisa bye, n'akagamba nti, \"Genda, obizzeeyo mu kibuga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalenzi bwe kaamala okugenda, Dawudi n'avaayo mu kifo eky'obukiikaddyo, n'agwa wansi mu maaso ga Yonasaani n'amuvuunamira emirundi esatu. Ne bagwaŋŋana mu bifuba ne bakaaba, naye Dawudi ye yasinga okukaaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yonasaani n'agamba Dawudi nti, \"Genda mirembe, kubanga fembi twelayirira omukwano mu linnya lya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga twogera nti, '",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye mujulirwa wakati wo nange, ne wakati w'ezzadde lyo n'ezzadde lyange emirembe gyonna.' \" Dawudi n'agenda, ne Yonasaani n'addayo mu kibuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
